      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "既能造吞噬敌人的巨蛇，也能搭复杂生物电路",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "whether you want to be a massive serpent that swallows other creatures whole or to tinker with complex mechanisms and circuitry.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3011360/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "沙盒模式可预演造物方案并研究敌人生物学",
